  << /ActualText (UX\057UI Designer                                                                                                                   Nov 2025 \023 Present\nSopra Steria Next \267 Milan\054 Italy\nBuilt and maintained a scalable Figma design system with 1\056000\053 components for a 5\055person cross\055functional team\054 ensuring consistency and scalability across enterprise\055level products\056\nLed website redesigns for large\055scale corporations\054 defining new visual styles and optimizing product interface design end\055to\055end\056\nCollaborated with multidisciplinary teams in an Agile environment\054 contributing to design critiques\054 team syncs\054 and iterative delivery\056\n\nUX Researcher \046 Interaction Designer                                                                         Jul 2025 \023 Mar 2026\nPolitecnico di Milano \267 Milan\054 Italy\nDeveloped an evidence\055based UX framework for transparency and perceived  safety in autonomous personal aerial vehicles\nApplied mixed\055method research \05050 online interviews \053 20 in\055person SUS\057UEQ\057SEQ sessions\051 combined with rapid prototyping to validate interaction concepts\n\nUX Researcher \046 Product Development Consultant                                                Feb 2025 \023 Jun 2025 Jiangnan University \327 \314I Foguang \267 Wuxi\054 China \n\042 Conducted systematic user research on a thermal cup product line\054 mapping European consumer \n   behaviours\054 usage contexts and unmet needs \n\042 Developed product adaptation concepts covering form\054 material and functionality to align with \n   European market expectations \n\042 Translated research findings into actionable product development recommendations\054 directly \n    supporting the client\047s cross\055cultural market entry strategy\n\nUX\057Aviation Designer and Consultin with client                                                        Jul 2021 \023 Dec 2023\nMBVision \267 Italy \057 Finland\nDesigned the interior cabin for the LA\0558 Seaplane \024 a hardware\055software interaction challenge from concept through functional prototypes\nLed usability testing and qualitative research across aviation\054 automotive\054 and museum sectors\nLead client\055facing UX workshops across Italy and Finland\054 presenting research  insights and facilitating co\055design sessions with senior stakeholders\n\137Responsible for editing the book \035Hydroracers\054 the Schneider Trophy Epic \174 The Illustrated History\035\056\n\nAugmented Reality Instructor \137100 hours                                                                Mar 2023 \023 Oct 2023\nITS MAR \267 Florence\054 Italy\nInstructed a class of 23 students in the development of Augmented Reality applications and innovative design methodologies\056\n\nCoordinator and Designer\1373 editions                                                                                        2021 \023 2023\nCreac\251tivity event \267 Piaggio Museum    \nCoordinator\054 on\057offline designer and curator of communication\054 internal and\240 external relations of the Creac\251tivity event\054 3 editions\054 XVI \0502021\051\054\240 XVII \0502022\051\054  XVIII \0502023\051\240 in collaboration with the Piaggio Foundation\056)
